    "title": "Police arrest Doylestown man for burglary at CB West High School - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Police have arrested a suspect in a burglary that took place Aug. 3 at Central Bucks West High School along Court Street in Doylestown. The Central Bucks Regional Police Department announced on Aug. 6 that Albert McLaughlin of Doylestown had been taken into custody for the burglary at the Central Bucks high school. Police alleged that the suspect, who was seen on surveillance camera, \"entered the school unlawfully,\" showered, and stole food and clothing early the morning of Aug. 3. Authorities had released surveillance video photos in an effort to identify the man who broke in. McLaughlin was arraigned and sent to Bucks County Prison with a bail set at 10% of $100,000. Jess Rohan can be reached at jrohan@gannett.com.",
